                     TO WS-NOMBRE-COM(INDICE-L:1)                               
                   ADD 1 TO INDICE-L                                            
                END-IF                                                          
                ADD 1 TO INDICE-P                                               
             END-PERFORM                                                        

           END-IF                                                               
              .                                                                 

