              PERFORM UNTIL INDICE-P > 10                                       
                 IF WS-CTIPOVIA(INDICE-P:2) NOT EQUAL SPACES                    
                    MOVE WS-CTIPOVIA(INDICE-P:1)                                
                                         TO WS-DOMICILIO-COM(INDICE-L:1)        
                    ADD 1 TO INDICE-L                                           
                 END-IF                                                         
                    ADD 1 TO INDICE-P                                           
              END-PERFORM                                                       

              IF INDICE-L NOT EQUAL XN-I                                        
                 ADD 1 TO INDICE-L                                              
              END-IF                                                            

              MOVE 1 TO INDICE-P                                                
              MOVE X160N315-PDO-GDOMICILIO-S(XN-I)   TO WS-GDOMICILIO           

              PERFORM UNTIL INDICE-P > 105                                      
                 IF WS-GDOMICILIO(INDICE-P:2) NOT EQUAL SPACES                  
