                                      TO WS-DOMICILIO-COM(INDICE-L:1)           

                    ADD 1 TO INDICE-L                                           
                 END-IF                                                         
                 ADD 1 TO INDICE-P                                              
              END-PERFORM                                                       
           END-IF                                                               
           ADD 1 TO XN-I                                                        
           END-PERFORM                                                          
