      ******************************************************************        
        2230-COMPACTAR-TIPO-PORCETAJE.                                          
      ******************************************************************        
      ** COMPACTAREMOS EL TIPO DE RETENCION CON SU PORCENTAJE                   
           INITIALIZE WS-TIPO-RET-COM                                           
           INITIALIZE WS-TIPO-RET-SALIDA                                        
           SET SW-SI-PORCENTAJE                TO TRUE                          

           EVALUATE X372VT10-TIPOEMI-E                                          
              WHEN CT-01                                                        
                 MOVE TB-PORRETCAP(XN-A)       TO WS-PORCT                      
              WHEN CT-02                                                        
                 MOVE TB-PORRETCOMP1(XN-A)     TO WS-PORCT                      
              WHEN CT-03                                                        
                 MOVE TB-PORRETCOMP2(XN-A)     TO WS-PORCT                      
           END-EVALUATE                                                         

      * ELIMINAR ESPACIO ENTRE LITERAL Y PORCENTAJE                             

           MOVE 1 TO INDICE-P                                                   
           MOVE 1 TO INDICE-L                                                   

           PERFORM UNTIL INDICE-P > 38                                          
              IF WS-TIPO-RETENCION-PORCT(INDICE-P:2) NOT EQUAL SPACES           
                 MOVE WS-TIPO-RETENCION-PORCT(INDICE-P:1)                       
                                   TO WS-TIPO-RET-COM(INDICE-L:1)               
                 ADD 1 TO INDICE-L                                              
              END-IF                                                            
              ADD 1 TO INDICE-P                                                 
           END-PERFORM                                                          

      * INTRODUCCION DE PUNTOS EN LA VARIABLE                                   

           MOVE 1 TO INDICE-P                                                   
           MOVE 1 TO INDICE-L                                                   

           PERFORM UNTIL INDICE-P > 41                                          
              IF WS-TIPO-RET-COM(INDICE-P:2) NOT EQUAL SPACES                   
                 MOVE WS-TIPO-RET-COM(INDICE-P:1)                               
                                   TO WS-TIPO-RET-SALIDA(INDICE-L:1)            
                 ADD 1 TO INDICE-L                                              
              ELSE                                                              
                 IF SW-SI-PORCENTAJE                                            
                    MOVE '%'       TO WS-TIPO-RET-SALIDA(INDICE-L:1)            
                    ADD 1          TO INDICE-L                                  
                    SET SW-NO-PORCENTAJE  TO TRUE                               
                 ELSE                                                           
                    MOVE '.' TO WS-TIPO-RET-SALIDA(INDICE-L:1)                  
                    ADD 1 TO INDICE-L                                           
                 END-IF                                                         
              END-IF                                                            
              ADD 1 TO INDICE-P                                                 
           END-PERFORM                                                          
                 .                                                              

      ******************************************************************        
        2240-ALFANUMERICO-IMPORTE.                                              
      ******************************************************************        
      ** INTRODUCIMOS UN VALOR IMPORTE PARA QUE EL MODULO NOS LO                
      ** DEVUELVA EN LETRAS                                                     
           INITIALIZE X001N007                                                  
           INITIALIZE WS-IMPLITERAL-COM                                         

           MOVE CT-C1                          TO X001N007-COPERACION           
           MOVE WS-GRELLENO                    TO X001N007-GRELLENO             
           MOVE WS-NLONG                       TO X001N007-NLONG                
           MOVE SPACES                         TO X001N007-CTIPOFRASE           

           EVALUATE X372VT10-TIPOEMI-E                                          
              WHEN CT-01                                                        
                  MOVE TB-IMPLIQCAP(XN-A)       TO X001N007-ECANTIDAD           
              WHEN CT-02                                                        
                  MOVE TB-ILIQCOMP1(XN-A)       TO X001N007-ECANTIDAD           
              WHEN CT-03                                                        
                  MOVE TB-ILIQCOMP2(XN-A)       TO X001N007-ECANTIDAD           
           END-EVALUATE                                                         

           IF X001N007-ECANTIDAD NOT EQUAL ZEROES                               
              CALL WS-B001N007 USING X001N007                                   

              IF X001N007-CRETORNO NOT EQUAL '00'                               
                 SET ERROR-GRAVE                TO TRUE                         
                 MOVE '12'                      TO X372VT10-CRETORNO-S          
                 MOVE 'B372N010'                TO X372VT10-GNOMPROG-S          
                 MOVE 'ERROR AL TRNAFORMAR EN LITERAL EL IMPORTE'               
                                                TO X372VT10-GERROR-S            
              END-IF                                                            

           END-IF                                                               

           MOVE 1 TO INDICE-P                                                   
           MOVE 1 TO INDICE-L                                                   

           PERFORM UNTIL INDICE-P > 80                                          
              IF X001N007-GNUMLITERAL(INDICE-P:2) NOT EQUAL SPACES              
                 MOVE X001N007-GNUMLITERAL(INDICE-P:1)                          
                   TO WS-IMPLITERAL-COM(INDICE-L:1)                             
                 ADD 1 TO INDICE-L                                              
              END-IF                                                            
              ADD 1 TO INDICE-P                                                 
           END-PERFORM                                                          


           MOVE WS-IMPLITERAL-COM                                               
           TO   X372VT10-IMPLITERAL-S(XN-B)                                     
              .                                                                 

      ******************************************************************        
       2250-BUSCAR-LITERAL-MESES.                                               
      ******************************************************************        
      * EVALUAMOS EL MES DE LA FECHA A TRATAR                                   
            INITIALIZE WS-FECHA-LITERAL-COM                                     
            INITIALIZE WS-MES-LIT                                               

            MOVE WS-FECHA-AUX(1:4)     TO ANO-LIT                               
            MOVE WS-FECHA-AUX(5:2)     TO WS-MES-LIT                            
            MOVE WS-FECHA-AUX(7:2)     TO DIA-LIT                               

            IF WS-MES-LIT = '01'                                                
               MOVE 'Enero' TO MES-LIT                                          
            END-IF                                                              
            IF WS-MES-LIT = '02'                                                
               MOVE 'Febrero' TO MES-LIT                                        
            END-IF                                                              
            IF WS-MES-LIT = '03'                                                
               MOVE 'Marzo' TO MES-LIT                                          
            END-IF                                                              
            IF WS-MES-LIT = '04'                                                
               MOVE 'Abril' TO MES-LIT                                          
            END-IF                                                              
            IF WS-MES-LIT = '05'                                                
               MOVE 'Mayo' TO MES-LIT                                           
            END-IF                                                              
            IF WS-MES-LIT = '06'                                                
               MOVE 'Junio' TO MES-LIT                                          
            END-IF                                                              
            IF WS-MES-LIT = '07'                                                
               MOVE 'Julio' TO MES-LIT                                          
            END-IF                                                              
            IF WS-MES-LIT = '08'                                                
               MOVE 'Agosto' TO MES-LIT                                         
            END-IF                                                              
            IF WS-MES-LIT = '09'                                                
               MOVE 'Septiembre' TO MES-LIT                                     
            END-IF                                                              
            IF WS-MES-LIT = '10'                                                
               MOVE 'Octubre' TO MES-LIT                                        
            END-IF                                                              
            IF WS-MES-LIT = '11'                                                
               MOVE 'Noviembre' TO MES-LIT                                      
            END-IF                                                              
            IF WS-MES-LIT = '12'                                                
               MOVE 'Diciembre' TO MES-LIT                                      
            END-IF                                                              

           MOVE 1 TO INDICE-L                                                   
           MOVE 1 TO INDICE-P                                                   

      * COMPACTAMOS LA FECHA ELIMINANDO ESPACIOS                                
           PERFORM UNTIL INDICE-P > 2                                           
              IF DIA-LIT(INDICE-P:2) NOT EQUAL SPACES                           
                 MOVE DIA-LIT(INDICE-P:1)                                       
                                     TO WS-FECHA-LITERAL-COM(INDICE-L:1)        
                 ADD 1 TO INDICE-L                                              
              END-IF                                                            
              ADD 1 TO INDICE-P                                                 
           END-PERFORM                                                          

           IF INDICE-L NOT EQUAL CT-UNO                                         
              MOVE ' de '            TO WS-FECHA-LITERAL-COM(INDICE-L:4)        
              ADD 4 TO INDICE-L                                                 
           END-IF                                                               

           MOVE 1 TO INDICE-P                                                   
           PERFORM UNTIL INDICE-P > 12                                          
              IF MES-LIT(INDICE-P:2) NOT EQUAL SPACES                           
                 MOVE MES-LIT(INDICE-P:1)                                       
                   TO WS-FECHA-LITERAL-COM(INDICE-L:1)                          
                 ADD 1 TO INDICE-L                                              
              END-IF                                                            
              ADD 1 TO INDICE-P                                                 
           END-PERFORM                                                          

           IF INDICE-L NOT EQUAL CT-UNO                                         
              MOVE ' de '          TO WS-FECHA-LITERAL-COM(INDICE-L:4)          
              ADD 4 TO INDICE-L                                                 
           END-IF                                                               

           MOVE 1 TO INDICE-P                                                   
              PERFORM UNTIL INDICE-P > 4                                        
              IF ANO-LIT(INDICE-P:1) NOT EQUAL SPACES                           
                 MOVE ANO-LIT(INDICE-P:1)                                       
                   TO WS-FECHA-LITERAL-COM(INDICE-L:1)                          
                 ADD 1 TO INDICE-L                                              
              END-IF                                                            
              ADD 1 TO INDICE-P                                                 
           END-PERFORM                                                          
                .                                                               

